WEBVTT

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:18.260
Turret Warrior attacks Full Armor Ogre!

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:19.860
Revolver Shot!

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:35.990
But when Full Armor Ogre is destroyed, I can 
Special Summon Gatling Ogre from my graveyard!

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.360
Gatling Ogre...

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:41.510
I end my turn.

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:44.800
I'll have 4 Speed Counters next turn.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:49.960
Since you're past the safety line, I'll shoot 
and defeat you the moment I draw a Speed Spell.

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:55.650
And if I draw a trap card, Gatling 
Ogre's effect will end you.

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:59.320
In other words, my draw 
is like a dynamite's fuse.

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:07.010
They're coming!

00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:08.910
They're persistent!

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:11.280
We'll be fine.

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:16.020
I'll fight and rescue this family.

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:41.080
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:46.620
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:51.090
Don't look back and keep going

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:56.930
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:01.900
There's no need to fear

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:09.570
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:15.580
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:21.320
Streak to the infinite future

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:26.720
Dreams surpass their limits

00:02:26.990 --> 00:02:34.830
And will lead you to a bright place

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:08.970
Deadly Riding Duel

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:28.320
We always capture escapees, dead or alive!

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:30.340
Don't let them escape from this mountain!

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:33.850
Kiryu!

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:41.190
I won't let them capture us!

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:44.660
How's that!

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:53.500
Damn!  Send the grim reaper 
back to the afterlife!

00:03:56.890 --> 00:03:57.630
Do it!

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:02.810
Dad, what's wrong?

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:03.520
Dad!

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:06.380
It's the collar.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:10.570
Dad, are you okay?

00:04:10.570 --> 00:04:11.360
Are you in pain?

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:13.300
I'm fine.

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:15.340
He's lying.

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:19.340
Kiryu!

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:21.900
What?

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:29.410
It stopped!

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:36.280
I won't let you escape!

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:41.300
Kiryu!

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:50.450
Nico!

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:56.230
What are you doing?  After them!

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:03.920
Nico!

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:10.090
It's fine, Nico.

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:13.820
No!  I'll never let go!

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:15.170
Nico...

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:19.930
Kiryu, you can't let go either!

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:35.840
Kiryu!

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:46.880
Thank you.  You saved me.

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:47.820
Same here.

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:49.480
It's all thanks to you.

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.110
Stop it.

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:56.860
You're in this situation 
because I kept winning.

00:05:56.860 --> 00:05:58.390
It's the same for me.

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:08.940
Nothing I ever did paid off, 
and I ended up in this town.

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:10.980
This is the end!

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:16.530
You did it!

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:20.490
I was happy.

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:26.480
I always looked pathetic to my children, but 
I now showed them that I was a strong Dad.

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:30.010
But that power was an illusion.

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:40.150
Don't do it!

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:47.530
Dad!

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:52.720
I knew I'd eventually end up like this.

00:06:53.250 --> 00:07:00.390
I finally realized that I was 
looking for a place to die.

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:02.630
A place to die...

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:08.470
Most people who come to this 
town feel the same as me.

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:14.900
But even I heard the rumor that a man 
kept winning in this land of death.

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:18.220
Everyone called him “the grim reaper.”

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:21.020
But I didn't agree.

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:25.670
After seeing you now, I'm certain!

00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:30.350
Even if this is a place to die, 
you have a strong will to live!

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:46.650
Here I go!  My turn!

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:49.470
The Speed Counter is 4.

00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:51.150
I'm past the safety line.

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:54.240
And he has Gatling Ogre on his field.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:59.810
If he draws either a trap or a Speed 
Spell, I'm guaranteed to lose.

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:03.480
What is it?

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:06.100
You're lucky.

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:10.870
But I release Gatling Ogre to 
Special Summon Big Cannon Ogre!

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:13.100
What?  Release Gatling Ogre again?

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:14.410
Another new strategy?

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:19.700
Yes.  There are various endings, 
but they all end badly for you!

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:27.290
What's that monster?

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:31.300
When Full Armor Ogre is in 
my graveyard, I can Special

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:36.530
Summon Big Cannon Ogre by releasing 
Gatling Ogre from my field.

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:39.160
But it only has 2400 attack points.

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:41.780
My Turret Warrior has 3000 attack 
points, so it's stronger.

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:44.020
That doesn't matter!

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:46.830
Big Cannon Ogre attacks Turret Warrior!

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:47.810
What?

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:53.900
I activate Skill Successor's 
effect from my graveyard.

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:58.610
By removing this card 
from play, one monster on

00:08:58.610 --> 00:09:01.680
my field gains 800 attack 
points until the End Phase.

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:08.550
Big Cannon Ogre's bullet can 
now pierce your monster.

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:10.310
Big Cannon Fire!

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:20.680
What?

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:29.350
Due to Big Cannon Ogre's effect, 
you take double the battle damage.

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:37.460
Big Cannon Ogre's attack points return to 
their original points at the End Phase.

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:40.150
I end my turn.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:45.630
I managed to survive, but like 
he says, the fuse is still lit.

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:57.240
Speed and wind, give me power!

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:24.700
They're catching up!

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:33.670
Kiryu, if we go right at that 
point, we'll be outside!

00:10:33.810 --> 00:10:34.910
Really?

00:10:36.710 --> 00:10:39.570
Can we evade them until then?

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:41.360
They must be kidding.

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:45.050
We won't let you take a single 
step outside this mountain.

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:53.880
The course changed!

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:54.920
Oh no!

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:04.640
You'll fall into the depths of hell!

00:11:08.610 --> 00:11:10.470
We're gonna fall!

00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:11.750
Damn!

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:17.000
If we can change that point...

00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:22.290
If I break that console, I can manually 
change direction with that lever.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:28.830
Dad?

00:11:29.090 --> 00:11:32.660
Kiryu, please listen to 
my unreasonable request.

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:35.570
Please take care of my children.

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:38.020
You're not going to-

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:44.000
I want to show them what I can do again!

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:49.880
Stop joking!  Show them that you're alive!

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:51.740
I'm fighting in order to live!

00:11:56.220 --> 00:11:56.840
Dad!

00:11:56.840 --> 00:11:59.830
Don't do it!

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:10.570
Dad!

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:11.470
Dad!

00:12:11.470 --> 00:12:13.280
Damn!  I won't let you do that!

00:12:25.150 --> 00:12:26.090
What?

00:12:34.890 --> 00:12:37.150
I won't let you!  Do it!

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:48.570
Dad!

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:09.910
Dad!

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:12.900
West, Nico!  Live!

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:25.850
Dad!

00:13:30.690 --> 00:13:33.320
Why?

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:37.280
Damn!  Don't let them escape!

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:39.720
Yeah, I won't let you escape!

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:54.480
Don't cry!

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:58.080
Your dad didn't show you how to die.

00:13:58.090 --> 00:14:00.960
He showed you how to live by protecting you!

00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:09.630
This time, I'll show you 
how Kyosuke Kiryu lives.

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:13.510
I'll protect you.

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:14.560
Kiryu.

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:16.790
Hang on tight.

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:18.160
Okay.

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:19.390
Okay.

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:32.240
My turn!

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:34.950
It's here!

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:39.850
Some cards are useless unless 
you believe in speed.

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:43.790
I activate Speed Spell - 
Fallen Synchron from my hand!

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:45.990
What?

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:49.890
I can activate it when I have 
5 or more Speed Counters.

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:53.650
By removing the required Synchro 
Material Monsters in my

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:56.500
graveyard from play, I can Special 
Summon a Synchro Monster!

00:14:57.210 --> 00:15:01.840
I remove Level 1 Sonic Chick and Level 5 
Quickdraw Synchron in my graveyard from play!

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:06.310
The powers come together to form 
a spear that pierces the land!

00:15:06.310 --> 00:15:07.830
Become the path that lights the way!

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:09.280
Synchro Summon!

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:12.030
Pulverize!  Drill Warrior!

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:17.950
Drill Warrior's effect activates!

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:23.930
By halving Drill Warrior's attack 
points, it can attack you directly!

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:24.850
What?

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:26.830
Drill Warrior attacks you directly!

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:28.220
Drill Shoot!

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:35.100
I activate the trap card Explosive 
Wall from my graveyard!

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:39.350
By removing this card in my 
graveyard from play,

00:15:39.350 --> 00:15:43.920
your attacking monster and all cards 
on my field are removed from play!

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:46.230
I'll get rid of that trap!

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:47.590
Kiryu!

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:49.720
Hold on tight!

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:51.190
What?

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:01.940
Kiryu!

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:09.260
It's the exit!

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:14.210
I won't let you escape from this mountain!

00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:17.410
What?

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:30.680
Activate, Explosive Wall!

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:38.690
I'll not only blow up all 
the cards, but also you!

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:43.930
What?

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:00.230
Kiryu!

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:03.660
Nico!

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:08.370
Kiryu!

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:10.940
Nico!

00:17:48.930 --> 00:17:51.710
They couldn't survive a 
fall from this height.

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:27.540
What's going on?

00:18:28.610 --> 00:18:30.090
What's this?

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:33.950
Hey brother, you finally woke up.

00:18:35.070 --> 00:18:39.290
Malcolm drank a lot and partied hard.

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:42.560
Barbara?

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:44.700
He said that this town belonged to me.

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:50.030
He renamed this town to Barbara Town 
and brought out the deed to the mine.

00:18:50.030 --> 00:18:53.420
What are you guys talking about?

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:56.120
I see.  If it belongs to Barbara...

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:58.840
That means it belongs to me.

00:19:00.140 --> 00:19:03.020
Lotten, Barbara, you betrayed me!

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:06.750
Starting today, this is Lotten Town!

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:10.720
You think you can get away with this?

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:39.030
I couldn't do anything.

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:45.730
Nico, West, their father and Yusei...

00:19:46.110 --> 00:19:54.950
You all protected me, but 
I couldn't protect anyone.

00:19:55.550 --> 00:19:59.300
That's not true.  You tried 
to protect those kids.

00:19:59.780 --> 00:20:03.460
That's pointless because 
I failed to protect them.

00:20:20.680 --> 00:20:22.200
We're back here again.

00:20:41.730 --> 00:20:42.980
I'm sorry.

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:46.170
I failed.

00:20:46.820 --> 00:20:49.360
I was a corpse after all.

00:20:53.360 --> 00:20:57.940
Kiryu, this Duel Disk is still alive.

00:20:58.750 --> 00:20:59.960
I see.

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:06.440
You won't allow this to 
be my final resting place.

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:17.930
I'll become the grim reaper again!

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:21.140
I'll drag them down into a real hell!

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:24.480
And this time, I'll save Nico and West!

00:21:24.740 --> 00:21:26.830
Kiryu, I'll also fight.

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:28.730
Together again.

00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:42.130
Lend me your strength.

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:48.350
Satisfy me!

00:22:14.750 --> 00:22:19.450
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:24.460
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:29.330
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:29.330 --> 00:22:34.370
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:34.570 --> 00:22:39.240
The cruel god tests us

00:22:39.540 --> 00:22:46.180
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:46.180 --> 00:22:50.010
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:55.890
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:56.050 --> 00:22:59.790
Bond is the proper word

00:22:59.790 --> 00:23:05.760
As we fight, we understand each other

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:08.730
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:08.730 --> 00:23:10.970
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:10.970 --> 00:23:15.610
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:18.480
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:18.480 --> 00:23:21.950
You want to party until the morning

00:23:21.950 --> 00:23:25.180
At our special place
